\strong{Disparity signal.} For training rows a target is computed by
\code{\link[=fairgate_disparity_target]{fairgate_disparity_target()}} from the outcome, the protected group and
the out-of-fold base score; a regression on the features and the
link-scale base score predicts it, cross-fitted in the same way, and the
prediction is given to the gate only.

\strong{Search and selection.} \code{n_draws} configurations drawn by
\code{\link[=fairgate_draw_configs]{fairgate_draw_configs()}} are fitted on \code{inner} and scored on its
validation rows; the selection rule is described under \code{perf_tolerance},
